  津和野名物「源氏巻（げんじまき）」と「うずめ飯」とは？\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed pl-6 border-l-2 border-amber-200\">\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">A.</span> こしあんを薄いカステラ生地で巻いた伝統銘菓『源氏巻』と、ご飯の下に具材（人参、椎茸、里芋、鯛など）をうずめて出汁をかけて食べる郷土料理『うずめ飯』が人気です。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"my-12 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-stone-50 via-amber-50/40 to-orange-50/30 border border-amber-200/80 shadow-md\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 border-b border-amber-200 pb-3\">\n    <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-600 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">関連記事ナビ</span>\n    <h3 class=\"text-base md:text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">🗺️ あわせて読みたい！島根県＆周辺エリアの厳選宿ガイド</h3>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 my-4\">\n    <!-- 同一都道府県エリア特集 -->\n    <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200/90 shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n      <h4 class=\"text-xs font-black text-amber-900 flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-amber-100 pb-2\">\n        <span>📍</span> 島根県のエリア別・後悔回避宿特集\n      </h4>\n      <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/autumn-chugoku-matsutake-shimane-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition line-clamp-1\">👉 【2026最新】島根県おすすめ観光名所＆名物グルメ・美肌温泉宿完全ガイド！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">出雲・玉造</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/iwami-ginzan-yunotsu-sanbe-hotels-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition line-clamp-1\">👉 【2026年最新】石見銀山・温泉津温泉・三瓶山おすすめ宿10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">大田市・江津市（石見銀山大森地区・温泉津温泉・三瓶温泉・三瓶山高原）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/izumo-taisha-tamatsukuri-onsen-hotels-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition line-clamp-1\">👉 【2026年最新】出雲大社・玉造温泉おすすめ高級宿10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">出雲市・松江市玉湯町（出雲大社正門前・日御碕・玉造温泉街・稲佐の浜）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/matsue-shinji-lake-mihonoseki-hotels-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition line-clamp-1\">👉 【2026年最新】松江・宍道湖おすすめ高級旅館10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">松江市（松江しんじ湖温泉・宍道湖畔・松江城下町・美保関港）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 近隣・隣接都道府県の人気特集 -->\n    <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200/90 shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n      <h4 class=\"text-xs font-black text-orange-900 flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-orange-100 pb-2\">\n        <span>🚗</span> 周遊・隣接エリアのおすすめ特集\n      </h4>\n      <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/tottori-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-orange-700 transition line-clamp-1\">🏨 【鳥取県】【2026年最新】鳥取おすすめ温泉旅館・ホテル10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">鳥取県全域（皆生温泉米子境港・三朝温泉倉吉・鳥取砂丘鳥取市・大山）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/hiroshima-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-orange-700 transition line-clamp-1\">🏨 【広島県】【2026年最新】広島おすすめホテル・名旅館10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">広島県全域（宮島・広島市街・尾道しまなみ・鞆の浦・呉江田島）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/yamaguchi-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-orange-700 transition line-clamp-1\">🏨 【山口県】【2026年最新】山口おすすめ温泉旅館・ホテル10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">山口県全域（長門湯本角島・萩城下町・湯田温泉山口市・下関関門海峡）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center border-t border-amber-200/60 mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3\">\n    <a href=\"/prefectures/features\" class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-700 hover:text-amber-900 underline\">\n      🎌 全47都道府県の厳選特集一覧を見る →\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n"
